  "annotations": [
    {
      "body": "According to the online archive of the Austrian Society for Literature (https://www.ogl.at/programm/aktuelles-programm/archiv/1963/5), Auden participated in the Internationales Kassner-Symposium (International Rudolf Kassner Symposium), which opened on Sunday, 12 May 1963. Auden gave a talk on "Begegnung mit dem Werk Rudolf Kassners" ("Encounter with the Work of Rudolf Kassner") on Friday, 17 May 1963. Programm",
