    {
      "body": "Delighted to hear you are zu Haus. No, I didnt get any letter from you. Perhaps it is in the .U.S., I shall be in Vienna this coming week on Monday, Thur Wednesday and Friday. Will try to call you to-morrow to arrange a meeting.",
      "certainty": undefined,
      "details": {},
      "evidence": [],
