          "resourceIds": [],
        },
        {
          "content": {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": 
"Chester in Florence.
Die Baronin
 Stella M￼s￼lin
Wien III
Neulinggasse 26
Fridau,
 Obergrafendorf,
 bei ST.PÖLTEN,
 NÖ
W.H.Auden,
KIRCHSTETTEN (WESTBAHN)
 HINTERHOLZ 6
N.-Ö., AUSTRIA
"
,
          },
          "id": "amp-transcript__0001.xml:id("transcription_amp_0001")/div[1]",
          "kind": "envelope",
          "order": 1,
          "parentId": "amp-transcript__0001.xml:id("transcription_amp_0001")",
          "parentOffset": 0,
          "provenance": {
            "selector": "id("transcription_amp_0001")/div[1]",
            "source": "amp-transcript__0001.xml",
          },
          "resourceIds": [
            "amp-transcript__0001.xml:id("amp-transcript__0001.xml")/facsimile[1]/surface[1]/graphic[1]",
            "amp-transcript__0001.xml:id("amp-transcript__0001.xml")/facsimile[1]/surface[2]/graphic[1]",
          ],
        },
        {
          "content": {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": 
"Sunday.KIRCHSTETTEN (WESTBAHN)
 HINTERHOLZ 6
N.-Ö., AUSTRIA
Dear Stella:
 Delighted to hear you are zu Haus.
 No, I didnt get any letter from you. Perhaps
 it is in the .U.S., I shall be in Vienna this
 coming week on Monday, Thur Wednesday and Friday.
Will try to call you to-morrow to arrange
 a meeting. 
Chester is at the moment in Florence,but
 I expect him back on Tuesday. 
love
Wystan
"
,
          },
          "id": "amp-transcript__0001.xml:id("transcription_amp_0001")/div[2]",
