        {
          "content": {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": 
" Dear Stella: 
Saturday will be fine. Shall
 look forward to it,
 love 
Wystan
￼(2 ￼P.T.O. 
"
,
          },
          "id": "amp-transcript__0040.xml:id("transcription_amp_0040")/div[2]",
